/* The dialogs of Windows 10 (uk-UA), written by tools/res2rc.py from
 * ntshrui.dll.mui (the Sharing page, Advanced Sharing, New Share, the two
 * pages of the sharing wizard), aclui.dll.mui (the permissions page) and
 * objsel.dll.mui (Select Users or Groups, Object Types, Locations).
 *
 * Changed by hand, and nothing else: the folder's picture is an icon and not
 * a bitmap; the wizard's pages are children of Arctic's own wizard window;
 * the names of Select Users or Groups are typed into an edit box (RICHEDIT50W
 * there), its label is a text (a link to the help there) and its window is
 * not resized; "Додатково..." of it is disabled, there is nothing to search;
 * the help links of the permissions page and of the wizard are left out. */

